Attribution
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

BlancheDeCiel-mod is an original static block editor. It is not the
PenguinMod web application, and it does not vendor the PenguinMod GUI or
VM build (those projects currently require a Node.js 16 / webpack 4
toolchain that does not build reproducibly on current Node). It is
intended to be compatible with a documented subset of Scratch 3 and
PenguinMod projects and extension conventions.

Block category colours for the core categories are taken from
PenguinMod-Blocks (itself the Scratch Blocks palette):

  vendor/penguinmod-blocks/core/colours.js
